{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3lzgft4m5uk24","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","uri":"at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3lzgft4m5uk24","cid":"bafyreig7t5i23phlcve6js3qy7s45gslo422lteywntxvmgepuvcs7wehy","auteur_did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/agenetet.bsky.social/post/3lzgft4m5uk24","date":"2025-09-22T12:27:42.379Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-09-22T12:27:46.410Z","text":"Quelle belle énergie à Arras pour cette rentrée Renaissance, aux côtés de Gabriel Attal !\n\nUn week-end riche d’échanges, de débats et de moments conviviaux entre militants.\n\nNotre mouvement continuera de porter des idées fortes, de bousculer : pour une nouvelle République.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreib6sr46474qs64wdpjfc6k7xsayagw4w2rkq62agcpy4ukeitpxim","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreib6sr46474qs64wdpjfc6k7xsayagw4w2rkq62agcpy4ukeitpxim","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1440}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreibezngcylh5jcqs7rhnzgabotdcgm2dqjlviufpnezruc4jz6fela","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreibezngcylh5jcqs7rhnzgabotdcgm2dqjlviufpnezruc4jz6fela","alt":"","ar":{"height":1333,"width":2000}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreigpv227f4mpsw2qpupevcvulrtk4jpswkr3tbrhdlbdsw4eluxn5q","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreigpv227f4mpsw2qpupevcvulrtk4jpswkr3tbrhdlbdsw4eluxn5q","alt":"","ar":{"height":1280,"width":1023}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreifgfzybkw7tn3jsd6wyhmacoyihya2